sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant K as Checkout (context)
  participant S as ExpressShipping (strategy)
  C->>K: new Checkout(new StandardShipping())
  C->>K: setStrategy(new ExpressShipping())
  Note over C,K: estratégia trocada em tempo de execução
  C->>K: total(order)
  K->>S: calculate(order)
  S-->>K: frete calculado
  K-->>C: subtotal + frete
